    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 103 Rathmount is an elegant, luxurious detached home in the ever-popular residential development of Rathmount, Blackrock. This spacious, perfectly presented home is finished to an exceptional standard with high quality finishings and offers a light filled interior throughout. The residence extends to c. 1,956 sq. ft. (181 sq. mtrs.) with rooms of generous proportion making it the ideal family home.\n\nThe beautifully appointed accommodation at ground floor level includes a welcoming entrance hall, sitting room with bay window and feature fireplace with solid fuel stove, superb living room, open plan kitchen and dining room with generous glazing, utility room and guest wc. Upstairs, there are four double bedrooms, one of which is en-suite and also a large stylish family bathroom. The mature, landscaped front and rear gardens are designed for pleasure and ease of maintenance, completing the picture. The large rear garden is very private with all day sun; allowing for evenings to be spent dining out on the extensive patio area.\nThis truly magnificent property must be viewed to fully appreciate all the benefits it has to offer, with some additional special features including double glazed windows throughout, private rear garden with sandstone patio and generous parking to the front.\n\nThe property is situated on a prime position, within the popular Rathmount development with the spectacular Blackrock Park a stone's throw from this residence. Blackrock is a vibrant bustling seaside village which benefits from a welcoming selection of family friendly amenities including schools and sports facilities alongside the popular beach promenade with a selection of boutique shops, cafes, restaurants and shops. There is a choice of two top primary schools also within easy reach. The property also offers easy access to Dundalk town and the M1 motorway. \n\nViewing of this property is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nSitting Room - 5.23m x 4.11m\n\n\nDining Room - 3.45m x 3.15m\n\n\nKitchen - 4.27m x 3.45m\n\n\nUtility Room - 2.36m x 2.28m\n\n\nLiving Room - 5.80m x 3.66m\n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.11m x 4.04m\n\n\nEn-Suite - 2.95m x 1.07m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.57m x 3.66m\n\n\nHotpress - 1.10m x 0.70m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.50m x 3.20m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.18m x 3.18m\n\n\nBathroom - 3.28m x 3.18m\n\n\n - \nTOTAL FLOOR AREA: 181.0 sq.m. (1,948 sq.ft.) Approx.\n\n"
